{"step_index":236,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:21:21Z","thinking":"**Defining Hero Section Styles**\n\nI'm now focusing on styling the hero section in `public/css/styles.css`. My current thinking is centered on ensuring the `.landing-hero` section is full-height using `min-height` or `calc()`, and implementing flexbox for centered content. I'm also addressing the need for a high-contrast dark overlay to ensure text readability against the collage background, specifically using `rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.88)`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   StreamWave Entertainment - Responsive Media Platform Stylesheet\n   Dark Graphite Theme with Restrained Red Accent & Full Accessibility\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --bg-base: #121214;\n    --bg-surface: #18181c;\n    --bg-elevated: #222228;\n    --bg-hover: #2e2e36;\n    \n    --border-color: #2e2e38;\n    --border-focus: #e50914;\n\n    --text-primary: #f4f4f6;\n    --text-secondary: #a0a0ab;\n    --text-muted: #6e6e7a;\n\n    --accent-red: #e50914;\n    --accent-red-hover: #b80710;\n    --accent-red-subtle: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.15);\n\n    --font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    --radius-sm: 4px;\n    --radius-md: 6px;\n    \n    --shadow-card: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    --shadow-dialog: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n}\n\n/* Base Resets & Overflow Protection */\n*, *::before, *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml {\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}\n\nbody {\n    background-color: var(--bg-base);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-family: var(--font-family);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\n.library-body {\n    padding-bottom: 110px; /* Space so fixed audio player never obscures footer */\n}\n\n/* Screen Reader Only Utility Class */\n.sr-only {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 1px;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: -1px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    border: 0;\n}\n\na {\n    color: inherit;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\nbutton, input, select {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: inherit;\n}\n\n/* Accessibility Focus Visible */\n*:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-red) !important;\n    outline-offset: 2px !important;\n}\n\n/* Reduced Motion Respect */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    *, *::before, *::after {\n        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n        scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n    }\n}\n\n/* Navigation Bar */\n.navbar {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 100;\n    height: 70px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.nav-container {\n    max-width: 1240px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 1.5rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.brand {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.brand-logo-img {\n    height: 48px;\n    max-height: 52px;\n    width: auto;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    display: block;\n    transition: transform 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.brand-logo-img:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.02);\n}\n\n.footer-logo-img {\n    height: 36px;\n    width: auto;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    display: block;\n}\n\n.nav-links {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    transition: color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.developer-link {\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    background-color: var(--accent-red-subtle);\n    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.3);\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.btn-signin-nav {\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    padding: 0.35rem 0.95rem;\n}\n\n.member-nav-controls {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.member-badge {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.35rem;\n    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-size: 0.775rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.btn-sm {\n    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n.pulse-dot {\n    width: 7px;\n    height: 7px;\n    background-color: #10b981;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10b981;\n}\n\n/* Full-Height Viewport Centered Hero Section */\n.landing-main {\n    flex: 1;\n}\n\n.landing-hero {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: calc(100vh - 70px);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;\n    background-color: #0b0b0d;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.22) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.96) 75%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574375927938-d5a98e8ffe85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80');\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.88) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.75) 50%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.98) 100%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.landing-hero-content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    max-width: 820px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.academic-badge-pill {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n    background-color: rgba(24, 24, 28, 0.92);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.8rem;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-size: 0.725rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n.landing-hero-title {\n    font-size: 3.15rem;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.12;\n    letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.landing-hero-subtitle {\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.landing-hero-instruction {\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    margin-top: 0.2rem;\n}\n\n.landing-start-form {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 620px;\n    margin-top: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.input-action-group {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    width: 100%;\n}\n\n.input-action-group input {\n    flex: 1;\n    background-color: rgba(22, 22, 26, 0.92);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 0.95rem 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.input-action-group input:focus {\n    border-color: var(--accent-red);\n}\n\n.btn-get-started {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 0.95rem 1.75rem;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n.btn-get-started .chevron {\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    margin-left: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n/* Landing Page Sections */\n.landing-section {\n    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.section-container {\n    max-width: 1140px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.landing-section-title {\n    font-size: 2rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n}\n\n.section-subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    margin-top: -1.75rem;\n    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;\n}\n\n/* Benefits Grid */\n.benefits-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.benefit-card {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.benefit-icon {\n    font-size: 2.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n.benefit-card h3 {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.benefit-card p {\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n/* Steps Grid (How It Works) */\n.steps-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 1.75rem;\n}\n\n.step-card {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.step-number {\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 42px;\n    background-color: var(--accent-red);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.step-card h3 {\n    font-size: 1.15rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n}\n\n.step-card p {\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n/* Payment Badges */\n.payment-badges-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.payment-badge {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.notice-pill {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background-color: var(--accent-red-subtle);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.4);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* Checkout Page Styling */\n.checkout-main {\n    max-width: 1040px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 2rem auto;\n    padding: 0 1.5rem;\n    flex: 1;\n}\n\n.simulation-alert-banner {\n    background-color: #2b1d05;\n    border: 1px solid #d97706;\n    color: #fef3c7;\n    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.85rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;\n}\n\n.alert-icon {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.alert-text strong {\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n}\n\n.alert-text p {\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    margin-top: 0.15rem;\n    opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.checkout-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.35fr;\n    gap: 1.75rem;\n}\n\n.summary-box, .payment-form-box {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 1.75rem;\n}\n\n.box-title {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.015em;\n}\n\n.plan-card {\n    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n.plan-badge {\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n}\n\n.plan-name {\n    font-size: 1.35rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin-top: 0.15rem;\n}\n\n.plan-price {\n    font-size: 1.75rem;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    margin: 0.65rem 0 1rem 0;\n}\n\n.price-period {\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.plan-benefits-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.check-icon {\n    color: #10b981;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin-right: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.form-group {\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.form-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 0.825rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.form-input {\n    width: 100%;\n    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    outline: none;\n    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.form-input:focus {\n    border-color: var(--accent-red);\n}\n\n/* Method Tabs */\n.method-tabs {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.method-tab {\n    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    padding: 0.65rem 0.5rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.method-tab.active {\n    background-color: var(--accent-red-subtle);\n    border-color: var(--accent-red);\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.interface-box {\n    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.demo-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: 0.675rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.step-sequence-list {\n    margin-top: 0.85rem;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n}\n\n.step-item {\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n}\n\n.step-bullet {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    font-size: 0.65rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n}\n\n.help-text {\n    font-size: 0.775rem;\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    margin-top: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.test-card-preview {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f2937 0%, #111827 100%);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.mastercard-theme {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #374151 0%, #1f2937 100%);\n}\n\n.card-chip {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 24px;\n    background-color: #d97706;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.card-number-display {\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-size: 1.15rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n}\n\n.card-details-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.simulation-status-box {\n    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n    border: 1px solid var(--accent-red);\n    padding: 1rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.status-success {\n    border-color: #10b981;\n    background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);\n}\n\n.status-declined {\n    border-color: #ef4444;\n    background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);\n}\n\n.status-spinner {\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n    border: 2px solid var(--border-color);\n    border-top-color: var(--accent-red);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;\n    margin: 0 auto 0.5rem auto;\n}\n\n.simulation-step-text {\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.progress-bar-track {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 6px;\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    bo